51" value="" style="metaUml=legend-swatch;html=1;fillColor=#a5d8ff;strokeColor=#1971c2;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;glass=0;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="133" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-text-52" value="aktivitas sistem" style="metaUml=legend-text;text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#495057;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1566" y="130" width="202" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-swatch-53" value="" style="metaUml=legend-swatch;html=1;fillColor=#ffd8a8;strokeColor=#e8590c;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;glass=0;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="153" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-text-54" value="layanan eksternal QRIS Simulator" style="metaUml=legend-text;text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#495057;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1566" y="150" width="202" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-swatch-55" value="" style="metaUml=legend-swatch;html=1;fillColor=#d0bfff;strokeColor=#9c36b5;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;glass=0;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="173" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-text-56" value="operasi basis data" style="metaUml=legend-text;text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#495057;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1566" y="170" width="202" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-swatch-57" value="" style="metaUml=legend-swatch;html=1;fillColor=#ffec99;strokeColor=#e67700;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;glass=0;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="193" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-text-58" value="decision — guard pada edge keluar" style="metaUml=legend-text;text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#495057;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1566" y="190" width="202" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-swatch-59" value="" style="metaUml=legend-swatch;html=1;fillColor=#e9ecef;strokeColor=#495057;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;glass=0;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="213" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-legend-text-60" value="merge — cabang bergabung ulang" style="metaUml=legend-text;text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fontColor=#495057;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1566" y="210" width="202" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-note-61" value="Catatan dari kode:&#10;• Tidak ada payment gateway pihak ketiga. Pelunasan QRIS disimulasikan&#10;  oleh layanan terpisah di port 8000 dan/atau dicatat di tabel&#10;  `qris_transactions` Supabase.&#10;• `POST /api/transactions` menulis status 'success' LANGSUNG (mode&#10;  simulasi skripsi) lalu mengaktifkan Pro — lihat&#10;  server/routes/transactions.routes.js.&#10;• Jalur alternatif: `POST /api/webhook/qris-paid` untuk aktivasi dari&#10;  simulator, dan `PUT /api/transactions/:id/verify` bila admin yang&#10;  memverifikasi transaksi berstatus pending (alur 02D)." style="metaUml=note;shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff9db;strokeColor=#e67700;strokeWidth=1.5;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontColor=#212529;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1530" y="272" width="560" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="02c-caption-62" value="Pembayaran langganan Pro melalui QRIS Simulator: transaksi QRIS dibuat &amp; dipantau lewat Supabase, lalu Pro diaktifkan oleh backend Express." style="meta